('Is AIM free?', f'{AVAILABILITY}. There are no purchasing or account steps on this website. Availability may change in the future.'),
('Which systems can run it?', 'AIM is a Windows x64 desktop application. Use Windows 10 or Windows 11. macOS and Linux editions are not available.'),
